1 Experience ( For starting one )<br /> B. 5 Experience ( 1 XP for each Attainment )<br /> C. 6 Experience ( For starting and each Attainment )<br /> D. More than 6 XP ( Because each Novel Attainment is even higher cost on this all, changing cost higher )?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-01T17:07:28-07:00","id":979941,"title":"","content":"As I understand it, 1XP to join Legacy, must be AXP if founded, then 1XP for each Attainment thereafter, must be AXP if novel/self-taught. You do get new Oblations and Yantras for joining a Legacy after all, not like you're going without benefit.<br /> <br /> So, C is my answer.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12121,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12121-ainsoph","user":"AinSoph","date":". 10-01-2016, 08:09 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12121-ainsoph","name":"AinSoph","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"35"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-01T21:51:28-07:00","id":980080,"title":"","content":"You also have to take the spell base of each attainment as a Praxis, representing advanced study of the effect.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6084-2pttakrill","name":"2ptTakrill","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:"